# "Healthy has fuck" book notes

> Last updated 14.5.2023

It's about the body you choose and how much effort you want to put in to maintain it.

* Fill half of every plate with vegetables. People are overconsuming protein and under-consuming vegetables.
* Sleep well
* Back away from the booze
* Chill and meditate. You don't have to choose stress.
* Eat it all, but eat less of it.
* Prep your food
* Exercise persistently

It's about being happy now and not about how happy you will be once you reach a weight goal.

Alcohol damages your fitness results.

Exercise persistently is a crucial factor in maintaining your weight.

Put some kick-ass new music to get you pumped.

Being healthy is now average. So you will be a particular case which denies a drink. 

Half-ass Habits Count. Make the highs higher and the lows about higher too. The all-or-nothing strategy only works in the short run when you are too hard on yourself.

Falling is part of the drama. Just get up and try it again.

Your life starts right now, not once you reach your weight goal.

